            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>To provide such a medical tube that a position of a distal end part thereof is easily detectable from an outside of a body of a patient, regardless of orientation of the distal end part inserted into the body.A medical tube including: a main body part having a tubular shape; at least one opening formed in a side face of a main body part; and a light transmitting part formed at one end of the main body part, the light transmitting part having a hemispherical face shape, the light transmitting part being configured to emit light from a light source.</p>
            </abstract>
